<body class="bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 bg-white my-8 rounded-xl border">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: November 16, 2026</p>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 text-sm">
      <p>We want you to be satisfied with ProToolNest.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Free Trial</h2>
      <p>New users receive a free trial period. No payment is required during the trial. You will only be charged if you do not cancel before the trial ends.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Refunds</h2>
      <p>If you are charged and are not satisfied, contact us within 7 days of the charge at support@protoolnest.com. We will review refund requests on a case-by-case basis.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6">Cancellations</h2>
      <p>You can cancel your subscription at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. We do not provide prorated refunds for partial months.</p>
